  "comments": "<p>This coin also exists under KM#117 in some Editions of Standard Catalog of World Coins.<br><br>Two variants exists for 1974 and 1976.<br>Die <strong>1</strong> - all details small, legend far from beads, cross of crown to the right of a bead, <strong>I</strong> in ELIZABETH between beads, 136 beads.<br>Die <strong>2</strong> - all details large, legend closer to beads, cross of crown to a bead, <strong>I</strong> in ELIZABETH to a bead, 121 beads.<br><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/5f05778e1b032.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/5f05778e1b032.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a></p>",
